  "contentHtml": "<p>안녕하세요. 윤근후입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://sci-val.vercel.app\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://sci-val.vercel.app</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Scival · 사이벌\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"sci-val.vercel.app\" data-og-source-url=\"https://sci-val.vercel.app\" data-og-url=\"https://sci-val.vercel.app\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://sci-val.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://sci-val.vercel.app\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Scival · 사이벌</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">sci-val.vercel.app</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4dd717287fa6d6963d437f1b9eee82e7c38ac44\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b4dd717287fa6d6963d437f1b9eee82e7c38ac44\" data-origin-width=\"3014\" data-origin-height=\"1732\"></div><p>뱀파이어 서바이벌처럼 만든 게임입니다. 기본 틀은 뱀파이어 서바이벌하고 같은데, 능력 얻으려면 문제를 풀어야 하는 그런 전개입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>이번에 처음으로 거의 원프롬프트로 만들어봤는데 기대 이상이네요. AI풍이 좀 강하긴 하지만 재미만 있으면 되죠.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생들 간 경쟁도 가능하고, 모바일에서도 잘 돌아갑니다.</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb2bd1ab790198dd112518968aa14dedfe53992d\" data-origin-width=\"2868\" data-origin-height=\"1320\" style=\"width:82.52%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cb2bd1ab790198dd112518968aa14dedfe53992d\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e72dd0d535e765d948bde54d35ae77c2543a129\" data-origin-width=\"1320\" data-origin-height=\"2868\" style=\"width:17.48%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e72dd0d535e765d948bde54d35ae77c2543a129\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>--------------------</p><p>(26. 10. 09 수정)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>크롬 브라우저에서 랜더링이 심하게 느린 버그 수정했습니다.</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
